{"parentUuid":"72ff332f-543d-481a-8e8b-2f868aca45b3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a14425d770a8fc220","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GCJXoHhDmMd7dFmhxAmmzS","type":"tool_result","content":"== package-formats-vfs | expert runtime | parent resource-streaming-architect | ws content | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Package/container format and chunking, codec selection, VFS mount layering (base, patch, DLC, mods), encryption and signing, install-chunk layout.\n  NR: Patch generation ->packaging-release-patching; Relocatable data layout ->serialization-schema\n  prov ['C-VFS'] cons ['C-IO', 'C-SER'] tool [] impl []\n== world-architect | lead runtime | parent engine-architect | ws world | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: World representation strategy (data-oriented, no universal scene graph), partitioning and streaming cells, streaming sources, HLOD strategy, simulation LOD and significance, large-world coordinate policy, level transitions, server-side world streaming.\n  NR: World document format ->world-data-model; Transform math ->spatial-transforms; HLOD mesh generation ->virtualized-geometry-lod\n  prov ['C-WORLD', 'C-SIGNIF', 'C-ENV'] cons ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-RES', 'C-ECS?', 'C-VIEW', 'C-FRAME'] tool [] impl []\n== world-data-model | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: World and level documents, prefabs with nested overrides and variants, data layers, one-file-per-object layout for collaboration, level instances.\n  NR: Serialization mechanics ->serialization-schema; Source-control workflows ->collaboration-version-control\n  prov [] cons ['C-WORLD', 'C-SER', 'C-ASSET', 'C-ID', 'C-RELOAD?'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== spatial-transforms | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Transform representation and parallel hierarchy propagation, attachments, large-world coordinates implementation, generic spatial index and query service for non-physics consumers, spatial hashing.\n  NR: Physics broadphase ->collision-detection; GPU culling ->geometry-pipeline\n  prov ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-VIEW'] cons ['C-MATH', 'C-ECS?', 'C-TASK', 'C-ID'] tool [] impl []\n== terrain | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Terrain end-to-end: representation, rendering, material layering, sculpt/paint tool logic, runtime deformation, collision data hand-off.\n  NR: Virtual texturing core ->texture-streaming-vt; Viewport hosting ->world-editor-viewport; Collision algorithms ->collision-detection\n  prov [] cons ['C-WORLD?', 'C-RSCENE?', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-RES', 'C-MATIF?', 'C-ENV', 'C-INSTANCES?', 'C-VT?'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl ['C-ENV']\n== vegetation-foliage | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Vegetation instancing and rendering, procedural placement rules, wind and interaction, vegetation-specific LOD.\n  NR: Generic PCG framework ->procedural-generation; Impostor generation ->virtualized-geometry-lod\n  prov [] cons ['C-WORLD?', 'C-RSCENE?', 'C-RES', 'C-ENV?', 'C-INSTANCES?', 'C-TEMPORAL?'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== water-ocean | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Ocean spectral simulation, rivers, lakes and shorelines, water surface rendering, water queries for buoyancy.\n  NR: Buoyancy dynamics ->character-physics; Fluid solvers ->fluid-simulation\n  prov [] cons ['C-WORLD?', 'C-RSCENE?', 'C-RG?', 'C-ENV', 'C-LIGHT?', 'C-GI?', 'C-TEMPORAL?'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl ['C-ENV']\n== atmosphere-weather | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Sky and atmospheric scattering, volumetric clouds, volumetric fog and local media, weather state and surface response, time of day.\n  NR: Sky lighting capture for GI ->global-illumination; Translucency compositing ->translucency-decals\n  prov ['C-ATMOS'] cons ['C-RSCENE?', 'C-RG?', 'C-FRAME', 'C-ENV', 'C-LIGHT?', 'C-TEMPORAL?'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl ['C-ENV']\n== procedural-generation | expert runtime | parent world-architect | ws world | prof ['openworld'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Deterministic graph-based PCG framework usable in editor and at stream-in, placement and scattering rules, grammar and constraint methods; evaluates ML generation.\n  NR: Foliage-specific rules ->vegetation-foliage; Graph editor UI ->graph-editor-framework\n  prov [] cons ['C-WORLD', 'C-DET', 'C-ML?', 'C-INSTANCES?'] tool ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST', 'C-GRAPH'] impl []\n== render-architect | lead runtime | parent engine-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Rendering architecture: pipeline organization, shading-path choice (forward+, deferred, visibility buffer), render-feature contract, render scene and world→render sync, scalability tiers from 2D mobile to path-traced, multi-view, debug modes, render threading.\n  NR: API backends ->gpu-platform-architect; Pass scheduling ->render-graph-scheduling; Individual features (GI, shadows…) ->owning-skill\n  prov ['C-RSCENE'] cons ['C-RG', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-MATIF', 'C-FRAME', 'C-FLOW', 'C-VIEW', 'C-GPUTIER', 'C-ECS?', 'C-XRVIEW?', 'C-INSTANCES?', 'C-A11Y'] tool [] impl []\n== rhi-core | expert runtime | parent gpu-platform-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Render hardware interface over D3D12, Vulkan, Metal, console APIs and WebGPU: queues and command recording, synchronization, bindless descriptors, PSOs and PSO caching, presentation, capability tiers, GPU crash breadcrumbs, driver workarounds.\n  NR: GPU memory allocation ->gpu-memory-resources; Barrier planning ->render-graph-scheduling; Shader compilation ->shader-system; Per-API backend code ->['rhi-d3d12', 'rhi-vulkan', 'rhi-metal', 'rhi-webgpu', 'platform-console']\n  prov ['C-RHI'] cons ['C-PAL', 'C-SYNC', 'C-PRESENT', 'C-FRAME'] tool [] impl []\n== gpu-memory-resources | expert runtime | parent gpu-platform-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: GPU heaps and suballocation, residency and overcommit, upload/readback rings, sparse/reserved resources, GPU memory budgeting and defragmentation, lifetimes decoupled from frame boundaries.\n  NR: Transient aliasing plans ->render-graph-scheduling; Texture streaming policy ->texture-streaming-vt\n  prov ['C-GPUMEM'] cons ['C-RHI', 'C-GPUTIER', 'C-LIFETIME'] tool [] impl []\n== render-graph-scheduling | expert runtime | parent gpu-platform-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Render graph declaration and compilation, automatic barriers, transient aliasing, async compute and multi-queue scheduling, TBDR pass merging, history resources, work-graph integration, general GPU compute, readback contract.\n  NR: Heap allocation ->gpu-memory-resources; Feature passes ->render-architect\n  prov ['C-RG'] cons ['C-RHI', 'C-GPUMEM', 'C-TASK'] tool [] impl []\n== shader-system | expert runtime | parent gpu-platform-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Shading language and dialect, compilation toolchain, permutations, reflection and binding layouts, interop headers, caches and distributed compilation, hot reload, shader debugging, PSO-list gathering.\n  NR: Material graphs ->material-system; Runtime PSO cache ->rhi-core\n  prov ['C-SHADER'] cons ['C-RHI', 'C-GPUTIER', 'C-ML?', 'C-RELOAD?'] tool ['C-COOK'] impl []\n== material-system | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Material model (OpenPBR-class, layered), material graph → shader code generation, instances and parameters, quality tiers, material validation; evaluates neural materials.\n  NR: BRDF research reference ->research-evidence; Graph editor UI ->graph-editor-framework; Shader compiler ->shader-system\n  prov ['C-MATIF'] cons ['C-SHADER', 'C-ASSET', 'C-MLGPU?', 'C-GPUTIER'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST', 'C-GRAPH'] impl []\n== geometry-pipeline | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Instance scene and geometry submission for every 3D tier: persistent instance data with batched delta updates, the CPU-culled batched/instanced path (first-class on TBDR/mobile and lite3d), and the GPU-driven path (GPU culling, indirect/mesh shaders, visibility buffer) for desktop/console tiers.\n  NR: Cluster LOD ->virtualized-geometry-lod; Render-scene contract ->render-architect\n  prov ['C-INSTANCES'] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-SHADER', 'C-GPUMEM', 'C-GPUTIER', 'C-GEOLOD?', 'C-TEMPORAL?'] tool [] impl []\n== virtualized-geometry-lod | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: All geometric LOD: cluster hierarchies and virtualized geometry, cluster DAG building, software micro-polygon rasterization, cluster streaming, discrete LOD, HLOD proxies and impostors, deforming-geometry LOD, displacement.\n  NR: HLOD strategy ->world-architect; Generic mesh optimization ->asset-cook-processors; RT acceleration structures ->ray-tracing-infrastructure\n  prov ['C-GEOLOD'] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-RES', 'C-RT?', 'C-INSTANCES'] tool ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== texture-streaming-vt | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Runtime texture formats, mip streaming, sampler-feedback streaming, virtual texturing, streaming-friendly cooked layout; evaluates neural texture compression.\n  NR: Texture encoding in cook ->asset-cook-processors; Streaming manager ->resource-streaming-architect\n  prov ['C-VT'] cons ['C-RES', 'C-GPUMEM', 'C-RG', 'C-ML?', 'C-MLGPU?'] tool ['C-COOK'] impl []\n== direct-lighting-shadows | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Light types and physical units, clustered light culling, stochastic many-light sampling, area lights, cascaded, virtual and ray-traced shadows, contact shadows, light profiles.\n  NR: Indirect lighting ->global-illumination; Denoisers ->reconstruction-upscaling\n  prov ['C-LIGHT'] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-RT?', 'C-TEMPORAL', 'C-INSTANCES?', 'C-GEOLOD?'] tool [] impl []\n== global-illumination | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Indirect lighting across tiers: baked lightmaps, probe volumes, screen-space GI and AO, surface/radiance-cache hybrid GI, ReSTIR GI, reflections, sky lighting, specular occlusion, SDF scene representations.\n  NR: RT infrastructure ->ray-tracing-infrastructure; Atmosphere model ->atmosphere-weather\n  prov ['C-GI'] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-RT?', 'C-TEMPORAL', 'C-LIGHT', 'C-ATMOS?', 'C-MLGPU?'] tool ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== ray-tracing-infrastructure | expert runtime | parent gpu-platform-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Acceleration structure management at scale, inline vs pipeline RT, opacity micromaps, RT LOD, software RT fallback, shader execution reordering, cluster/partitioned acceleration structures.\n  NR: Lighting algorithms using rays ->global-illumination; Deformed-geometry updates ->deformation-skinning\n  prov ['C-RT'] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-GPUMEM', 'C-INSTANCES', 'C-GPUTIER'] tool [] impl []\n== path-tracing | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Reference path tracer as ground-truth oracle for validation, real-time path tracing, offline cinematic render mode.\n  NR: Movie render orchestration ->cinematics-sequencer; Image comparison tests ->render-validation\n  prov [] cons ['C-RT?', 'C-MATIF', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-LIGHT', 'C-GI?'] tool [] impl []\n== reconstruction-upscaling | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Temporal anti-aliasing and reconstruction, temporal and ML upscalers, frame generation, dynamic resolution, the motion-vector/jitter/history contract, spatiotemporal and ML denoising, variable-rate shading.\n  NR: Signal-specific sampling ->global-illumination; Frame pacing ->frame-orchestration\n  prov ['C-TEMPORAL'] cons ['C-RG', 'C-FRAME', 'C-PRESENT', 'C-MLGPU?'] tool [] impl []\n== post-color-hdr | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Post chain, physical camera and exposure, end-to-end color management (working space, output transforms, OCIO), HDR output and calibration, tonemapping, grading.\n  NR: Display enumeration ->platform-desktop; Upscaling ->reconstruction-upscaling\n  prov [] cons ['C-RG', 'C-RHI', 'C-CFG', 'C-A11Y', 'C-PAL'] tool [] impl []\n== translucency-decals | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Transparency and OIT, refraction and distortion, decals, translucent lighting and volumetric integration.\n  NR: Particle simulation ->vfx-particles; Volumetric media ->atmosphere-weather\n  prov [] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-MATIF', 'C-LIGHT', 'C-GI?', 'C-ATMOS?', 'C-TEMPORAL'] tool [] impl []\n== character-rendering | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Skin subsurface scattering, eyes, strand-based hair and fur rendering, digital-human LOD.\n  NR: Hair simulation ->cloth-deformables; Skinning ->deformation-skinning\n  prov [] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-MATIF', 'C-ANIM', 'C-RG', 'C-LIGHT', 'C-GI?'] tool [] impl []\n== render-2d-vector | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: 2D draw backend shared by 2D games, UI and debug overlays: sprites, tilemaps, 2D lighting, vector paths, UI batching/clipping/SDF, HDR compositing, pixel-perfect modes.\n  NR: Widget model ->ui-architect; Glyph shaping ->text-fonts\n  prov ['C-DRAW2D'] cons ['C-RG', 'C-SHADER', 'C-TEXT', 'C-TEMPORAL?', 'C-A11Y'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== vfx-particles | expert runtime | parent render-architect | ws rendering | prof ['all'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: GPU particle simulation, VFX graph runtime, ribbons/beams/mesh particles, particle collision, VFX budgets and significance.\n  NR: Physically based fluids ->fluid-simulation; Translucency sorting ->translucency-decals\n  prov [] cons ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-LIGHT?', 'C-GI?', 'C-ATMOS?', 'C-TEMPORAL?', 'C-ENV?', 'C-A11Y'] tool ['C-GRAPH', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== physics-architect | lead runtime | parent engine-architect | ws simulation | prof ['min2d', 'lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Physics architecture: build vs integrate decision, physics world representation and ECS integration, stepping and frame sync, determinism levels, physics LOD, materials, GPU offload evaluation; covers both 2D and 3D.\n  NR: Collision algorithms ->collision-detection; Solvers ->rigid-body-dynamics; Networked physics ->prediction-rollback\n  pro