g and decompression, compression, blending/layering/masks/additives, retargeting, curves and notifies, 2D skeletal and flipbook animation.\n  NR: State machines ->animation-graphs; IK ->ik-procedural-animation\n  prov [] cons ['C-ANIM', 'C-MATH'] tool ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== deformation-skinning | expert runtime | parent animation-architect | ws simulation | prof ['lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: GPU skinning (linear, dual quaternion), morph targets, ML deformers, deformed-geometry acceleration-structure updates, deformation motion vectors.\n  NR: Cloth ->cloth-deformables; Facial solvers ->facial-animation\n  prov [] cons ['C-ANIM', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-TEMPORAL', 'C-RT?', 'C-ML?', 'C-INSTANCES?'] tool [] impl []\n== animation-graphs | expert runtime | parent animation-architect | ws simulation | prof ['min2d', 'lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Animation graphs and state machines, blend spaces, graph compilation and data-driven evaluation, graph debugging and rewind.\n  NR: Graph editor UI ->graph-editor-framework; Motion matching ->motion-synthesis\n  prov [] cons ['C-ANIM'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST', 'C-GRAPH'] impl []\n== motion-synthesis | expert runtime | parent animation-architect | ws simulation | prof ['std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: Motion matching, learned motion matching and neural controllers, pose databases, trajectory prediction and gameplay coupling.\n  NR: ML runtime ->ml-inference-runtime; Locomotion gameplay ->character-movement\n  prov [] cons ['C-ANIM', 'C-MOVE?', 'C-ML?'] tool ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST'] impl []\n== ik-procedural-animation | expert runtime | parent animation-architect | ws simulation | prof ['min2d', 'lite3d', 'std3d'] | tg ['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] | pl None\n  P: IK solvers, foot placement, procedural animation, physical animation and active rag