otprint | Whole-process CPU+GPU+UMA footprint analysis per tier | memory-performance E | memory-allocators \n   snapshots | Memory snapshot capture & diff tooling | memory-performance E | observability-telemetry \n   attribution | Content-level memory attribution per asset, cell & feature | memory-performance E | content-pipeline-architect \n   peaks | Transition peak analysis (travel, cutscene preload, cell churn) | memory-performance E | resource-streaming-architect \n# OBS Observability & diagnostics\n ## OBS.LOG\n   logging | Structured logging | observability-telemetry E |  \n   tracing | Trace instrumentation (CPU, GPU, IO, memory zones) | observability-telemetry E |  \n   profilers | Profiler integrations (Tracy, Perfetto, PIX, Superluminal class) | observability-telemetry E |  \n   metrics | Metrics & counters | observability-telemetry E |  \n   stats | In-game stats overlays | observability-telemetry E | visual-debugging-tools \n   telemetry | Development & engineering telemetry pipeline | observability-telemetry E |  \n   consent | Telemetry privacy & consent | observability-telemetry E | security-engineering \n   remote | Remote diagnostics to devices | observability-telemetry E |  \n   hw-counters | Programmatic CPU PMU & GPU hardware-counter capture attributed to zones and passes | observability-telemetry E | rhi-core,gpu-performance,cpu-performance \n   trace-analysis | Engine-aware trace analysis & profiler UI (task graph, phases, loading, memory, render-graph passes) | observability-telemetry E | job-system-task-graph,resource-streaming-architect,memory-allocators,render-graph-scheduling \n   analytics | Gameplay analytics event schema, taxonomy & privacy classes; analytics-SDK boundary | observability-telemetry E | security-engineering,online-services-liveops \n ## OBS.CRASH\n   capture | Crash capture & minidumps | crash-diagnostics E |  \n   pipeline | Crash reporting, bucketing & triage | crash-diagnostics E |  \n   symbolication | Symbolication | crash-diagnostics E | ci-cd-automation \n   gpu | GPU crash dump ingestion & triage | crash-diagnostics E | rhi-core \n   hangs | Hang & watchdog detection | crash-diagnostics E |  \n   oom | OOM diagnostics | crash-diagnostics E | memory-allocators \n   asserts | Assert & ensure reporting | crash-diagnostics E |  \n   privacy | Client-side redaction of secrets/PII in dumps & logs, annotation allow-lists, retention | crash-diagnostics E | security-engineering,observability-telemetry \n   feedback | In-game bug/feedback capture boundary for players | crash-diagnostics E | functional-automation-soak \n# XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n ## XC.DET\n   levels | Determinism levels & per-subsystem contract | determinism-replay E |  \n   float | Floating-point determinism policy (flags, FMA, transcendentals) | determinism-replay E | math-simd-numerics \n   parallel | Deterministic parallel execution (ordered reductions) | determinism-replay E | job-system-task-graph \n   replay | Input & state record/replay for debugging | determinism-replay E |  \n   desync | Desync detection & state hashing | determinism-replay E |  \n   compat | Replay compatibility across builds | determinism-replay E | api-lifecycle-migration \n   snapshot | Frame-state snapshot/restore/resimulate protocol (C-SNAPSHOT) | determinism-replay E | ecs-runtime,physics-architect,animation-architect \n   replay-format | Replay container, timeline, stream registration & versioning (C-REPLAY) | determinism-replay E | input-system,replication,visual-debugging-tools \n   conformance | Determinism conformance matrix (toolchain × ISA × platform × cores × schedule) as CI gate | determinism-replay E | ci-cd-automation,test-architect,robustness-fuzzing \n   external-inputs | Recording nondeterministic external results (services, model outputs) into replays | determinism-replay E |  \n ## XC.ITER\n   protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration E |  \n   live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration E |  \n   coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration E |  \n   metrics | Iteration-time metrics (edit → see latency) | hot-reload-iteration E | developer-experience-docs \n ## XC.SEC\n   threats | Threat modeling | security-engineering E |  \n   coding | Secure coding & memory-safety policy | security-engineering E |  \n   trust | Trust boundaries for untrusted input | security-engineering E |  \n   supply-chain | Supply-chain security (SBOM, signing, reproducible builds) | security-engineering E | build-system-toolchains \n   secrets | Secrets management | security-engineering E | ci-cd-automation \n   tamper | Anti-tamper & DRM boundary | security-engineering E | anti-cheat-integrity \n   privacy | Privacy engineering | security-engineering E |  \n   sandbox | Mod / UGC sandbox policy | security-engineering E | modding-ugc \n   server-validation | Server-side cheat validation | anti-cheat-integrity E |  ['online']\n   anticheat | Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary | anti-cheat-integrity E |  ['online']\n   abuse | Exploit & economy-abuse detection signals | anti-cheat-integrity E | platform-services ['online']\n   score-integrity | Leaderboard & achievement submission validation | anti-cheat-integrity E |  \n   memory-safety | Memory-safety posture: hardened library modes, shipping bounds checks, memory-safe language for untrusted-input parsers, MTE/PAC | security-engineering M | core-runtime-architect \n   hardening | Exploit-mitigation & hardened-build matrix per platform (CFI, shadow stacks, allocator hardening) | security-engineering E | build-system-toolchains,memory-allocators \n   crypto-policy | Cryptography & TLS/certificate policy | security-engineering E | containers-core-types \n   vuln-response | Vulnerability intake, disclosure, severity SLAs & patch path to shipped titles | security-engineering E | packaging-release-patching,api-lifecycle-migration,build-release-archi