ure & permission manifest fields | plugin-system E |  \n ## XC.DX\n   api-docs | API reference generation | developer-experience-docs E |  \n   arch-docs | Architecture & subsystem documentation | developer-experience-docs E | engine-architect \n   samples | Teaching sample projects (contributes to integration suites) | developer-experience-docs E |  \n   templates | Project templates & creation | developer-experience-docs E |  \n   onboarding | Onboarding paths | developer-experience-docs E |  \n   doc-tests | Documentation testing (snippets compile and run) | developer-experience-docs E | test-architect \n   errors | Error-message & diagnostic quality standards | developer-experience-docs E |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"64bf85e1-3f8a-4e26-a70b-24fa47556720","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:22:50.476Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d56993b3-4ed8-45d7-b3a7-21701692d843","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
